  "overview": "Bali was my first trip abroad, so everything felt a little bigger than usual: the air, the roads, and the small courage of talking to strangers. I first knew Bali through the digital nomad community, and somehow came home with a few first international friends.\n\nThe food and I did not get along very well, so instant noodles and mall food quietly carried me through the trip. I was also lucky to be there during Galungan, a sacred Balinese Hindu celebration of Dharma winning over Adharma. A good first stamp on the passport, with a little chaos included.",
